---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client / Guest Viewer
    participant API as Leaderboard Controller
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB

    Client->>API: GET /api/v1/leaderboards/individual (SeasonID, Domain)
    API->>Cache: ZREVRANGE leaderboard:individual:{season_id}:{domain} 0 49
    
    alt Cache Hit (Data Exists in Redis)
        Cache-->>API: Return Top 50 Ranked Competitors
        API-->>Client: 200 OK (Fast Cached Response <= 50ms)
    else Cache Miss (Cache Expired or Empty)
        Cache-->>API: Null / Key Not Found
        API->>DB: Query Aggregated Points & Rank
        DB-->>API: Return Leaderboard Data
        API->>Cache: Repopulate Redis ZSET (ZADD) with TTL
        API-->>Client: 200 OK (DB Response)
    end